Project 5: Employee Attrition Analysis with Python

🎯 Business Problem

A company wants to understand employee turnover and identify factors associated with employees leaving the organization.

Business questions
What percentage of employees have left?
Which departments have the highest attrition?
Does salary affect attrition?
Does overtime affect attrition?
Does job satisfaction affect attrition?
Does employee age or tenure affect attrition?
Which factors are most strongly associated with attrition?
Can we build a model to predict employee attrition?

Dataset

